1. DEFINITIONS

"Licensor" means Rémi Bezot.

"API" means the Cycle Paradox Extension API package, including its source
code, types, interfaces, documentation and associated files.

"Cycle Paradox" means the game, its official software, content, services,
names, visual identity and extension mechanisms.

"Extension" means any mod, downloadable content, scenario, campaign,
integration or other content designed to interact with Cycle Paradox through
the API.

"Original Contribution" means material independently created by an Extension
author, excluding the API, Cycle Paradox, generic mechanisms, concepts,
interfaces and material owned or supplied by the Licensor.

"Commercial Use" means any sale, paid access, subscription, commission,
licensing fee, advertising revenue, sponsorship, paid feature, paid advantage
or other direct or indirect monetization connected to an Extension.

2. PERMITTED USE

Subject to this License, the Licensor grants a personal, non-exclusive,
non-transferable and revocable permission to:

a. download, inspect and compile the API;
b. use the API to develop and test Extensions privately;
c. distribute an Extension free of charge, provided that every condition of
   this License and the Community Content Policy is respected;
d. reproduce the unmodified API only where technically necessary for a
   permitted use, registry distribution or documentation hosting.

This is a source-available proprietary license. It is not an open-source
license.

3. CONDITIONS OF DISTRIBUTION

Every distributed Extension must:

a. state that it is compatible with Cycle Paradox;
b. identify itself clearly as unofficial unless the Licensor has authorized
   it as official;
c. credit "Cycle Paradox — Rémi Bezot / Bezotcorp";
d. include a visible reference to this License and the Community Content
   Policy;
e. identify the Extension author separately from the owner of Cycle Paradox;
f. declare the versions of the API and game with which it is compatible;
g. remain available without payment unless a separate written commercial
   agreement authorizes monetization.

4. PROHIBITED USE

Without the Licensor's prior written authorization, no person may:

a. make Commercial Use of an Extension or the API;
b. sell, sublicense, rent or commercially redistribute the API;
c. publish a modified version of the API as an alternative or replacement;
d. claim ownership of Cycle Paradox, the API or its extension mechanisms;
e. present an Extension as official, endorsed or affiliated;
f. use Cycle Paradox or Bezotcorp identifiers as the principal identity of
   another product, company or service;
g. remove or conceal notices of ownership, attribution or licensing;
h. use the API to circumvent security, access controls or commercial systems.

Commercial authorization, revenue sharing and platform distribution require
a separate written agreement. No commercial right is implied by access to the
API.

5. OWNERSHIP

The Licensor retains every right in Cycle Paradox, the API, its types,
interfaces, extension points, generic mechanisms, official content and
distinctive identifiers.

An Extension author retains rights in their Original Contributions. Those
rights grant no ownership or control over Cycle Paradox or the API and do not
remove the obligations imposed by this License.

An Extension author acquires no exclusive right over a general theme, genre,
mechanic, category, historical period, disaster type, pathogen, alien concept,
