The Licensor may independently create official content involving similar
ideas or themes. Similarity alone does not establish copying, authorization,
ownership or entitlement to payment.

6. ORIGINAL COMMUNITY MATERIAL

The Licensor receives no ownership of an Original Contribution merely because
it uses the API.

If the Licensor wishes to reproduce or substantially incorporate protected
original material from an Extension into paid official content, permission and
any compensation must be established through a separate written agreement.

Use of the Licensor's own API, interfaces, generic mechanisms or independently
created material does not constitute use of an Extension author's Original
Contribution.

7. EVOLUTION AND COMPATIBILITY

The Licensor may modify, replace or remove any API or extension point.

No stability, availability, maintenance or backward compatibility is
guaranteed. An Extension author is responsible for maintaining compatibility
and must not claim compatibility with a version that the Extension does not
support.

A good-faith technical, security, maintenance or design change is not an
eviction, even when it makes an Extension incompatible.

8. TERMINATION

The permission granted by this License terminates automatically upon breach.
After termination, the person in breach must cease distribution and use of the
